window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Nyro’s saga continues in book six of Vampire Court: </b><b><i>Black Knight</i></b><b>. </b></p> <p>Nyro doesn't want to lose his humanity. If he becomes a Rook, he will be forced to ingest the Black King's blood.</p> <p>But the moment he joined the Vampire Court, he forfeited his life. </p> <p>He has no right to choose, anymore.</p> <p><b>Immerse yourself in Vampire Court, an addicting fantasy series by </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> best-selling author Ingrid Seymour! Vampires like you've never seen before. A unique world that will capture you.</b></p>"; 
